===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|la|cauterium|t=branding iron}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|+}}

# {{lb|en|surgery}} The process of using either extreme heat or extreme cold to either cut or seal body tissue.
# {{lb|en|surgery}} A device used for cutting or sealing body tissue. {{rfclarify|en}}

